     = Disable\r\nGroup policy version              = Windows Defender Firewall\r\nRemote admin mode                 = Enable\r\n\r\nPorts currently open on all network interfaces:\r\nPort   Protocol  Version  Program\r\n-------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n8051   TCP       Any      (null)\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamlit/streamlit/issues/840/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamlit/streamlit/issues/840/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]